{"asset_key":"ep2/herohub_story_12411260","episode":"ep2","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"12411260","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1241126001:1":{"text":"我小时候当过乞丐、小偷、扒手。甚至为了一口面包，和野狗打架。","source_cn":"我小时候当过乞丐、小偷、扒手。甚至为了一口面包，和野狗打架。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75C38337C8C9D1B2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1241126002:1":{"text":"为了活下去，我不得不剪掉头发扮成男孩子，因为男孩更好找工作，而且不会被盯上。","source_cn":"为了活下去，我不得不剪掉头发扮成男孩子，因为男孩更好找...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72BAC3E4078F8664","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1241126002":{"text":"为了活下去，我不得不剪掉头发扮成男孩子，因为男孩更好找工作，而且不会被盯上。","source_cn":"为了活下去，我不得不剪掉头发扮成男孩子，因为男孩更好找工作，而且不会被盯上。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72BAC3E4078F8664","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1241126003:1":{"text":"锈锚港有很多像我这样的孩子，我是幸运的。","source_cn":"锈锚港有很多像我这样的孩子，我是幸运的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1CAC46EEBA78AAE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1241126004:1":{"text":"泰西欧收养我时，一开始也以为我是男孩。","source_cn":"泰西欧收养我时，一开始也以为我是男孩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4782BC87E6CCC206","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1241126005:1":{"text":"等他发现我是女孩时，我已经比他收养的其他男孩都要优秀。","source_cn":"等他发现我是女孩时，我已经比他收养的其他男孩都要优秀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01C38D5BDBC68FB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1241126006:1":{"text":"我的过去铸造了今天的我，我从不为过去感到羞耻。","source_cn":"我的过去铸造了今天的我，我从不为过去感到羞耻。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC6FEE75EF1AE88DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1241126007:1":{"text":"相反，我感谢过去的索尼娅，她想尽办法活下来，才有了现在的我。","source_cn":"相反，我感谢过去的索尼娅，她想尽办法活下来，才有了现在的我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF98EF05E927143EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1241126008:1":{"text":"哇……索尼娅好、好强大！","source_cn":"哇……索尼娅好、好强大！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE005D5A5879864A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1241126009:1":{"text":"好有力的发言！","source_cn":"好有力的发言！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC129FF9FFC0CAF5D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1241126010:1":{"text":"坦白说，我也羡慕过那些一生下来就不用为吃喝发愁的人。","source_cn":"坦白说，我也羡慕过那些一生下来就不用为吃喝发愁的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7236808DE75DDEA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1241126011:1":{"text":"他们不像我，因为没有后路，所以必须往前。","source_cn":"他们不像我，因为没有后路，所以必须往前。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x163C882AAB6BCF2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:16:1241126011":{"text":"他们不像我，因为没有后路，所以必须往前。","source_cn":"他们不像我，因为没有后路，所以必须往前。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x163C882AAB6BCF2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1241126012:1":{"text":"也有过，后来我想通了。","source_cn":"也有过，后来我想通了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7462B86AE24E88A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1241126013:1":{"text":"命运，是被时代和家庭钉在墙上的麻绳。","source_cn":"命运，是被时代和家庭钉在墙上的麻绳。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81A6A57C620BEE83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1241126014:1":{"text":"但除了那些无法改变的定点，我可以转动手腕，紧紧拽住绳子。","source_cn":"但除了那些无法改变的定点，我可以转动手腕，紧紧拽住绳子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x046E8BD1B1DE0EA3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1241126015:1":{"text":"我所缺失的，我会亲手拿到。","source_cn":"我所缺失的，我会亲手拿到。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x47EC922912EBD1E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1241126016:1":{"text":"更何况，我还有奈拉，她就是我的家人。","source_cn":"更何况，我还有奈拉，她就是我的家人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x35378FCBD596EFD3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1241126017:1":{"text":"我永远无法忘记，我们互相支撑度过的那段时光。","source_cn":"我永远无法忘记，我们互相支撑度过的那段时光。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x185E7FB2EF284FE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1241126018:1":{"text":"她不是也忘不了吗？所以现在回来找我了。","source_cn":"她不是也忘不了吗？所以现在回来找我了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE8F58AEBB168CF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1241126019:1":{"text":"索尼娅，这个冷笑话不好笑……","source_cn":"索尼娅，这个冷笑话不好笑……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B2D3FD2D814ADBA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:124112602